    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai resistito per <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0002> or<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0002>āae, <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0003> minut<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0003>āoi e <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004> second<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0004>āoi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
